# The main-branch distribution bundles must rebuild byte-identically.
# Newlines inside template
# literals end up in the bundle bytes, so a CRLF checkout would build bundles
# that differ from CI's LF build. Pin LF for everything in this package.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Release automation owns generated bundles on main. Feature branches keep
# their merge-base bundles; CI builds fresh output for verification only.
